From 4876ace8d49e3ad3bbd943c545a6724eb71d36e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 07:13:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Keep idle-eviction mock responses scoped to submitted
 commands

Match each scripted collaboration call only after its corresponding user
prompt enters the request. Complete background parent wakes through a
lower-priority repeating mock, keeping automatic subagent notifications
enabled. Require each explicit parent turn to complete successfully and
retain the original exact-once mailbox and restored-history assertions.

Red: native Windows job 117314405917 records an automatic completion wake
consuming the send_message mock before the corresponding user request.
The user turn receives HTTP 404 and unread mail is absent on child resume.
Focused native verification and fresh emitted-patch checks remain pending.
---
 .../tests/suite/v2/thread_unsubscribe.rs      | 45 ++++++++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 35 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

